w\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thank you, vent, but I think I was being unclear. I know where the medium Merit is I'm trying to figure out where the spirit Mentor or guide or ghost guide or what-have-you Merit is. Thank you again for the incredibly fast response, though.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh. There isn't one, specifically. Mentor (same book, pg. 51) could be used, and/or you might want to hack the Familiar Merit from Mage to be acceptable (instead of Mana/Essence conversion, do Willpower/Essence conversion).<br /> <br /> Otherwise, aren't they simply an allied NPC?<br /> <hr /><br /> You could also try converting the old Second Sight merits to 2E.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-28T08:27:38-07:00","id":1200438,"title":"","content":"Huh, thanks. Yeah, I guess they would be. Thanks again, Vent, the NPC idea is great!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Call Me <b>Ray</b>.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://southern-gothic.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Southern Gothic </a>- Welcome to New Calais","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/256-gnomish-american","name":"Gnomish American","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar256_3.jpg","